{"version":1,"content":"<p>西九文化區於10月15日至31日期間，聯同樂高（LEGO）舉辦首個戶外萬聖節派對「WestK x LEGO HERO-WEEN」。</p><p>活動以英雄及顆粒創意為主題，於藝術公園設置多個漫畫風格的主題打卡佈置與特別版角色。</p><p>（採訪及拍攝：談浩民）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.113248+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:07:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:57:39.903724+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416728+00:00","content_hash":"47ce21678f45f0d2ceb6b48bbf4edf4d5fcfa78c48bad454a8d39527a4aa04a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}